    },
    {
      "displayText": "큰일이에요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D070C77CC774C5D0C6940021001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제 휠구가 도로에서 폭주하고 있어요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81C0020D720AD6CAC000020B3C4B85CC5D0C11C0020D3EDC8FCD558ACE00020C788C5B4C6940021001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이대로 내버려뒀다간...\n사람이나 포켓몬과 부딪칠지도 몰라요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774B300B85C0020B0B4BC84B824B480B2E4AC04002E002E002E000AC0ACB78CC774B0980020D3ECCF13BAACACFC0020BD80B52ACE60C9C0B3C40020BAB0B77CC6940021001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "부탁이에요!\n배틀로 제 휠구를 멈춰 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BD80D0C1C774C5D0C6940021000ABC30D2C0B85C0020C81C0020D720AD6CB97C0020BA48CDB00020C8FCC138C6940021001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "붕부웅~!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BD95BD80C6C5007E00210000",
