      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "붕붕...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BD95BD95002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "다행이야!\n드디어 멈췄구나.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E4D589C774C57C0021000AB4DCB514C5B40020BA48CDC4AD6CB098002E001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "도로 한복판에서 휠구를 폭주하게 두다니,\n대체 무슨 속셈이시죠!?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B3C4B85C0020D55CBCF5D310C5D0C11C0020D720AD6CB97C0020D3EDC8FCD558AC8C0020B450B2E4B2C8002C000AB300CCB40020BB34C2A80020C18DC148C774C2DCC8E00021003F00100002011401A20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "많이 화가 난 모양이네요...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9CEC7740020D654AC000020B09C0020BAA8C591C774B124C694002E002E002E001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "야생 포켓몬과의 공생을 위해\n와일드 존 철폐를 꿈꾸고 있는<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n저스티스회입니다.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C57CC0DD0020D3ECCF13BAACACFCC7580020ACF5C0DDC7440020C704D574000AC640C77CB4DC0020C8740020CCA0D3D0B97C0020AFC8AFB8ACE00020C788B29400100001BE00000AC800C2A4D2F0C2A4D68CC785B2C8B2E4002E00100002011401A20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "휠구가 도로 한복판을 폭주하도록 유도해서\n포켓몬의 위험성을 어필하는 방식으로<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n저스티스회를 부정하려는 거 아닙니까!?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D720AD6CAC000020B3C4B85C0020D55CBCF5D310C7440020D3EDC8FCD558B3C4B85D0020C720B3C4D574C11C000AD3ECCF13BAACC7580020C704D5D8C131C7440020C5B4D544D558B2940020BC29C2DDC73CB85C00100001BE00000AC800C2A4D2F0C2A4D68CB97C0020BD80C815D558B824B2940020AC700020C544B2D9B2C8AE4C0021003F00100002011401A20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아, 아니에요!\n오, 오해예요!!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544002C0020C544B2C8C5D0C6940021000AC624002C0020C624D574C608C69400210021001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제 휠구가 갑자기 크게 회전하면서\n멋대로 폭주했을 뿐이라구요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81C0020D720AD6CAC000020AC11C790AE300020D06CAC8C0020D68CC804D558BA74C11C000ABA4BB300B85C0020D3EDC8FCD588C7440020BFD0C774B77CAD6CC6940021001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저스티스회를 부정할 생각은\n눈곱만큼도 없다니까요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800C2A4D2F0C2A4D68CB97C0020BD80C815D5600020C0DDAC01C740000AB208ACF1B9CCD07CB3C40020C5C6B2E4B2C8AE4CC6940021001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "고의가 아니더라도 포켓몬이 위험한 일을\n하게 두는 건 저희에게 해를 끼치는 행위!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACE0C758AC000020C544B2C8B354B77CB3C40020D3ECCF13BAACC7740020C704D5D8D55C0020C77CC744000AD558AC8C0020B450B2940020AC740020C800D76CC5D0AC8C0020D574B97C0020B07CCE58B2940020D589C704002100100002011401A20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이번 기회에 우리 저스티스회에서\n똑똑히 가르쳐 드리겠습니다!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774BC880020AE30D68CC5D00020C6B0B9AC0020C800C2A4D2F0C2A4D68CC5D0C11C000AB611B611D7880020AC00B974CCD00020B4DCB9ACACA0C2B5B2C8B2E4002100100002011401A20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "가... 가르쳐 주신다구요...?\n아프거나 무서운 건 사양인데요...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC00002E002E002E0020AC00B974CCD00020C8FCC2E0B2E4AD6CC694002E002E002E003F000AC544D504AC70B0980020BB34C11CC6B40020AC740020C0ACC591C778B370C694002E002E002E001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "먼저 자신의 포켓몬에 대해 자세히 알 것!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA3CC8000020C790C2E0C7580020D3ECCF13BAACC5D00020B300D5740020C790C138D7880020C54C0020AC83002100100002011401A20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "휠구는 의외로 공격적이라 유사시에\n고속으로 회전해서 몸통박치기를 합니다.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D720AD6CB2940020C758C678B85C0020ACF5ACA9C801C774B77C0020C720C0ACC2DCC5D0000AACE0C18DC73CB85C0020D68CC804D574C11C0020BAB8D1B5BC15CE58AE30B97C0020D569B2C8B2E4002E00100002011401A20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "로열 랭크가 높다면 포켓몬이\n트레이너인 당신을 따를 테지만<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n만약 그렇지 않다면...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B85CC5F40020B7ADD06CAC000020B192B2E4BA740020D3ECCF13BAACC774000AD2B8B808C774B108C7780020B2F9C2E0C7440020B530B97C0020D14CC9C0B9CC00100001BE00000AB9CCC57D0020ADF8B807C9C00020C54AB2E4BA74002E002E002E00100002011401A20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "휠구를 자력으로 저지할 수 있게\n저스티스회에서 단련하시는 겁니다!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n그럼, 이만 실례하겠습니다!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D720AD6CB97C0020C790B825C73CB85C0020C800C9C0D5600020C2180020C788AC8C000AC800C2A4D2F0C2A4D68CC5D0C11C0020B2E8B828D558C2DCB2940020AC81B2C8B2E4002100100001BE00000AADF8B7FC002C0020C774B9CC0020C2E4B840D558ACA0C2B5B2C8B2E4002100100002011401A20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "예, 옙!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C608002C0020C6190021001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "...그 시로 씨 밑에서\n수행을 해야 하는 걸까요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002EADF80020C2DCB85C0020C5280020BC11C5D0C11C000AC218D589C7440020D574C57C0020D558B2940020AC78AE4CC694003F001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "으으...\n그것도 싫은데 어쩌죠...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C73CC73C002E002E002E000AADF8AC83B3C40020C2EBC740B3700020C5B4CA4CC8E0002E002E002E001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
